[CHANGE] benchmarks/runs/ring_buffer_qwen_moe_1/parts/ring_buffer/tests/ring_buffer_impl_test.py: Implemented comprehensive unit test suite for RingBuffer singleton. Fixed import path to use package-qualified . Tests cover: (1) initial state — capacity=10, size=0, is_empty/is_full flags; (2) push with available capacity — stores item, returns None, increments size; (3) FIFO order — items returned in arrival order; (4) overwrite eviction — oldest item evicted/returned when full; (5) eviction verification — evicted items no longer accessible; (6) boundary flags — is_full at capacity, is_empty after emptying; (7) clear — resets size to 0, removes all items; (8) post-clear operations — fresh start after clear; (9) snapshot_items — FIFO order and non-mutating; (10) BufferEmptyError on pop of empty buffer.
[CHANGE] benchmarks/runs/ring_buffer_qwen_moe_1/parts/ring_buffer/lib/ring_buffer.py: Implemented interface module: BufferError and BufferEmptyError data types with __str__ methods, and RingBuffer Protocol with @poly_type decorator, @operation decorators on all methods, and @test_only on snapshot_items.
[CHANGE] benchmarks/runs/ring_buffer_qwen_moe_1/parts/ring_buffer/lib/ring_buffer_impl.py: Implemented concrete RingBuffer singleton with collections.deque(maxlen=10). Properties (capacity, size, is_empty, is_full) delegate to internal state. push returns evicted item when full, pop raises BufferEmptyError when empty, clear empties buffer, snapshot_items returns list copy.
